<title>GHANA: SOCCER-TOGO BEAT LIBERIA 2-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOGO BEAT LIBERIA 2-1 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togo beat Liberia 2-1 (halftime</p>
<p>1-1) in an African Nations Cup group six qualifying match played</p>
<p>in Ghana on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Togo -- Salou Bachirou 26, Assignon Komlaga 67</p>
<p>Liberia -- Jonathan Sogbie 24</p>
</text>
